        "Description": "Agent 47,\r\rFour targets. One method.\r\rAll four must be eliminated by consuming poison.\r\rThe targets are gathered in Dubai, surrounded by luxury, security, and plenty of things they would never suspect to be lethal.\r\rYour task is simple:\rMake sure each of them consumes poison.\r\rNo accidents. No bullets. No unnecessary complications.\r\rFour targets.\rFour doses.\rOne clean solution.\r\rGood luck, Agent.",
